# Run artifacts: the suite writes logs and pipeline build products on every
# run; neither is part of the distributed package or the public record.
*.log
qa/logs/
qa/fixtures/pipeline/output/

# The SSC submission zip is built from src/s/ at release time and mailed, not
# distributed from here. Committing it would leave a copy that goes stale the
# moment src/ changes while still claiming to be what was submitted.
stataqa_ssc.zip
